---
title: Key rotation with a Singleton Beacon
config:
  sequence:
    actorMargin: 20
    width: 110
---

%% Before: Satoshi trusts the keys of Stuart at version N.

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Stu as Stuart
    participant BTC as Bitcoin
    actor Sat as Satoshi

    Stu->>Stu: BTCR2 Update: add the new key.<br/>Sign it with the old key.
    Stu->>BTC: Beacon Signal:<br/>hash of the update
    BTC-->>Stu: 6 confirmations
    Stu->>Sat: Message signed with the new key,<br/>did, Sidecar Data
    Sat->>BTC: Resolve the DID
    BTC-->>Sat: Beacon Signal
    Sat->>Sat: Check the update against<br/>the hash. Apply it.
    Sat->>Sat: Verify the message.<br/>Trust the new key.
